all of these hassles.

00:41:17.020 --> 00:41:20.680
So we're hoping to make that--

00:41:20.680 --> 00:41:23.000
right now, this is
in private beta.

00:41:23.000 --> 00:41:26.620
But we're hoping to eventually
open that up to the public

00:41:26.620 --> 00:41:28.220
later this year.

00:41:28.220 --> 00:41:33.170
So email us at hello@descartes
if you're interested.

